{"id":"vod_lz_68196","vodId":"68196","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"散华礼弥","name_cn":"散华礼弥","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230803-1/619a3bcc0ab56e091856e57a7e7b2c50.jpg"},"summary":"散华礼弥（内田真礼 配音）本该是一个快乐活泼的女孩，可是与亡母过分想象的外貌激发了父亲散华团一郎（石冢运升 配音）超限度的溺爱和束缚，这让礼弥感到痛苦万分，甚至因此而失足从悬崖上摔落而死。没想到，礼弥的死却促成了她和偶然间邂逅的少年降谷千紘（木村良平 配音）之间的一段缘分。为了使爱猫复活，对僵尸极其狂热的降谷研发了一种怪异的药剂，他将这种药剂用在了已死的礼弥身上，没想到，礼弥居然以僵尸的形式重生了。　　就这样，僵尸礼弥顺其自然的成为了降谷家的寄宿者，而为了使礼弥能够重新成为普通的女孩，降谷开始为了研究新的药剂而开始了奔波。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-03 14:53:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":15,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24160_706c9be0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24159_fa0eacf5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24158_147b0978/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24161_11292e7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24162_922dc751/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24163_daeb877f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24165_680befe8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24164_995797bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24166_47d1a327/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24169_d94da719/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24167_b7992f40/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24168_88bd6649/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24171_4e2b6b9e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230802/24170_a280180d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip.l